          "id": 82,
          "start": 239.13,
          "end": 241.15,
          "en": "has nothing to do with Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 241.15,
          "end": 246.15,
          "en": "And now we want to let Vue know which part of this HTML code",
