        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 333.98,
          "end": 335.74,
          "en": "with this control section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 335.74,
          "end": 336.832,
          "en": "And we do use such features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 336.832,
          "end": 340.83299999999997,
          "en": "by passing an object to createApp.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 341.71,
          "end": 346.15,
          "en": "This is an object which we can use to configure this app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 346.15,
          "end": 350.94,
          "en": "We configure the various options of this app, you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 350.94,
          "end": 355.94,
          "en": "Now one key option, which we can set is the data option,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 356.96,
          "end": 358.86,
          "en": "the data configuration.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 358.86,
          "end": 361.04,
          "en": "And this name is not up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 361.04,
          "end": 362.81,
          "en": "It has to be data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 362.81,
          "end": 366.92,
          "en": "You can use some clearly defined specific keys.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 366.92,
          "end": 369.7,
          "en": "So property names in this object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 369.7,
          "end": 371.41,
          "en": "which you pass to createApp.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 371.41,
          "end": 373.9,
          "en": "You cannot just use any arbitrary names",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 373.9,
          "end": 377.5,
          "en": "because the Vue will look for these specific property names",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 377.5,
          "end": 380.32,
          "en": "like data, and a couple of other names you'll see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 380.32,
          "end": 381.47,
          "en": "throughout this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 382.39,
          "end": 384.06,
          "en": "So here we get the data key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 384.06,
          "end": 388.3,
          "en": "Data, once a function as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 388.3,
          "end": 390.36,
          "en": "So we could provide one like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 390.36,
          "end": 392.3,
          "en": "and that would be totally valid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
